{"id":"n62819-1-7","stage":0,"title":"쉬다 · 呼吸","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62819-1-7-1","ko":"머리가 어지러워요.","zh":"我头晕啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"머리가","meaning":"头","explanation":"머리：头；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"머리","audio":"/audio/74eee3ddf202a62b7596.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66234","senseId":"1","lemma":"머리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어지러워요.","meaning":"晕，晕眩","explanation":"어지럽다：晕，晕眩；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"어지럽다","audio":"/audio/1e2f790342e5cbb65c1d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14588","senseId":"1","lemma":"어지럽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"74eee3ddf202a62b","term":"머리","zh":"头","audio":"/audio/74eee3ddf202a62b7596.mp3","entryId":"66234","definition":"在人或动物身体中，包括脸和头发的脖子以上的部分。","pronunciation":["머리"]},{"id":"1e2f790342e5cbb6","term":"어지럽다","zh":"晕，晕眩","audio":"/audio/1e2f790342e5cbb65c1d.mp3","entryId":"14588","definition":"感觉周围的所有事物都在旋转一般而无法控制身体。","pronunciation":["어지럽따"]}],"audio":"/audio/db114b7fdbfe7a0371a9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62819-1-7-2","ko":"숨을 크게 한번 쉬어 보세요.","zh":"试着深呼吸一次吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"숨을","meaning":"呼吸","explanation":"숨：呼吸；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"숨","audio":"/audio/19b65768173f5897377a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62463","senseId":"1","lemma":"숨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"크게","meaning":"大，洪亮，嘹亮","explanation":"크다：大，洪亮，嘹亮；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66586","senseId":"6","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한번","meaning":"一下","explanation":"한번：一下","readings":[{"term":"한번","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57336","senseId":"2","lemma":"한번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쉬어","meaning":"呼吸，喘","explanation":"쉬다：呼吸，喘；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"쉬다","audio":"/audio/62b3b824836a1f2cb1c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62819","senseId":"1","lemma":"쉬다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보세요.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"19b65768173f5897","term":"숨","zh":"呼吸","audio":"/audio/19b65768173f5897377a.mp3","entryId":"62463","definition":"人或动物通过鼻子或嘴吸入和呼出空气的行为。","pronunciation":["숨ː"]},{"id":"d9eb2cf86baea929","term":"크다","zh":"大，洪亮，嘹亮","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3","entryId":"66586","definition":"音量很高。","pronunciation":["크다"]},{"id":"54e30ff4210956a6","term":"한번","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3","entryId":"57336","definition":"表示把某事当做试验来尝试。","pronunciation":["한번"]},{"id":"62b3b824836a1f2c","term":"쉬다","zh":"呼吸，喘","audio":"/audio/62b3b824836a1f2cb1c5.mp3","entryId":"62819","definition":"用鼻子或嘴吸入空气后再呼出。","pronunciation":["쉬ː다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/18f38f95173142d84b38.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.965,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62819","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":24,"sequenceScore":1.0556,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["试着深呼吸一次吧。","对不起，车太堵了，所以迟到了。","我头晕啊。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["试着深呼吸一次吧。","我头晕啊。","对不起，车太堵了，所以迟到了。"],"answer":0}]}
